-- CA_0149_la_trustee_area_boards_batch3.sql
-- LA-County TRUSTEE-AREA unified school boards, batch 3: Downey, Glendora, Hacienda La Puente, Monrovia.
-- Same pattern as CA_0144 / CA_0146: one X0002 polygon + SCHOOL sub-district per trustee area,
-- dissolved from the LA County Registrar-Recorder precinct layer (Political_Boundaries/MapServer/34,
-- DST_USD/DIV_USD; codes 3 Downey, 8 Glendora, 22 Hacienda La Puente, 9 Monrovia); offices move off the
-- whole-district row; stale holders closed (how_ended 'unknown', end date not researched); current
-- members seated; Nov 3 2026 trustee-area races.
--
-- ROSTERS: each district's own board page, plus its organizational-meeting minutes for the oath date
-- (so term starts here are day-precise). All holders found on these offices were stale.
--
-- SEAT COUNTS (decision 2026-09-22: add missing seats, delete seats that do not exist):
--   Downey has 7 trustee areas but the DB held 5 offices -> 2 cloned.
--   Glendora has 5 areas, the DB held 4 -> 1 cloned.
--   Hacienda La Puente has a 5-member board (board page + the Dec 11 2025 reorganization letter),
--   the DB held 7 offices -> the 2 surplus offices are DELETED (their stale terms cascade; no race
--   referenced them -- the pre-flight refuses otherwise).
--
-- NOTES: Monrovia TA 1 and TA 2 were filled by appointment to full terms after a 2024 failure to
-- elect (Ed Code 5328), so how_started 'appointed'. Downey TA 7: Joseph E. Manacmul was provisionally
-- appointed 2025-10-28 after Barbara Samperi died. Glendora TA 5 reuses the NetFile row for Michael
-- Munoz. Step 4b also carries two cleanups (Gary Hardie wrong-seat term; Aghakhanian's stored party).
BEGIN;

